{
  "$schema": "https://aka.ms/codetour-schema",
  "title": "GroupChat 03: Pro Scroll Control & Frame Sync / スクロール制御とフレーム同期",
  "tags": [
    "GroupChat",
    "Scroll Control",
    "useLayoutEffect",
    "requestAnimationFrame",
